{"unit_id": "tag:071N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的一个拟紧的（quasi-compact）且拟分离的（quasi-separated）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。对于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或Zariski拓扑（topology），都有典范的（canonical）同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射所涉及的概形，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "态射的拟紧条件，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的", "context": "态射的拟分离条件，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形态射，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "所给拟凝聚层，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "平展态射或平展拓扑，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "平展或Zariski拓扑，译名待批准"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "高阶推前的典范同构，待批准"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "高阶推前之间的同构，待批准"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:071N:proof", "translation": "我们对平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）证明此事；Zariski拓扑（topology）情形的证明略去。由概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0001>，层（sheaves）<MATH_0001>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），因此这一断言有意义。层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>是与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0003>\n关联的层（sheaf），其中<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>的一个对象（object），见景上上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0002>。按照我们的约定，右侧是<MATH_0006>在局部化（localization）<MATH_0007>上的限制（restriction）的平展上同调（<ACCENT_0002>tale cohomology），此局部化等于<MATH_0008>。由命题<REF_0003>，这一预层（presheaf）与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0009>\n相同，其中<MATH_0010>为投影（projection）。若<MATH_0011>是仿射的（affine），则它与<MATH_0012>相同，见概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0004>。由概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0005>，它等于<MATH_0013>，后者是<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>上的取值（value）。因此，模（modules）层（sheaves）<MATH_0016>与<MATH_0017>在<MATH_0018>的每个仿射的（affine）对象（object）上的取值（values）是典范同构的（canonically isomorphic），这蕴含它们是典范同构的（canonically isomorphic）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形上同调"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上上同调"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形上同调"}, {"sour